UID:LiVrZWRJ2L
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 81 mins (1h21m)\n\nSIFF DocFest A Macedonian folktal
 e comes to life when a wounded stork is rescued by an unlikely savior\, tr
 ansforming both of their lives for the better in this whimsical and breath
 taking new film from director Tamara Kotevska (Honeyland). North Macedoni
 a's Official 2026 Academy Awards® Submission for Best International Featu
 re.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/docfest/the-tale-of-silyan
 \n\nEstimated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
