DTSTAMP:20251023T020000Z
UID:3suXUn5vPl
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nSIFF DocFest A shocking medical d
 iscovery turns a college student’s life upside-down in this gripping fil
 m from the team behind Three Identical Strangers. Subject Jim Ambrose sche
 duled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/docfest/the-s
 ecret-of-me\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
