 s of the 20th century\, director Clint Bentley’s beguiling adaptation of
  Pulitzer Prize finalist Denis Johnson’s novella stars Joel Edgerton as 
 a humble labourer immersed in a rapidly changing world of natural splendou
 r and voracious industry.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/seat
 tle-film-critics-society-pnw-awards-2025/train-dreams\n\nEstimated start: 
