BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Rocky Horror Picture Show
DTSTART:20251101T023000Z
DTEND:20251101T050500Z
DTSTAMP:20251101T023000Z
UID:mMKH0ra5bD
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 138 mins (2h18m)\n\nStep into the time warp like you
 ’ve never seen it before. This Halloween season\, Seattle artists are br
 inging The Rocky Horror Picture Show to life with a dazzling twist—pole\
 , burlesque\, and drag collide with the cult classic film in a chaotic\, c
 ampy\, and deliciously risqué spectacle. As the movie plays\, performers 
 will leap off the screen (sometimes literally)\, battling the film itself 
 for your attention. Expect glitter\, fishnets\, corsets\, and wild surpris
 es around every corner. Whether you’re a seasoned creature of the night 
 or a Rocky virgin\, you’ll be swept into an evening of sin\, seduction\,
  and absolute pleasure. TICKET PRICING:Early Bird (through Oct 10) - $37.5
 0 ($35 SIFF Members)General (starting Oct 10) - $40 ($35 SIFF Members)Day-
 Of Show - $45 ($35 SIFF Members)\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theater
 s/rocky-horror-pole-show\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cinema Dissection: Inglourious Basterds
DTSTART:20251101T170000Z
DTEND:20251101T231500Z
DTSTAMP:20251101T170000Z
UID:7C1b3o2jSH
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 360 mins (6h00m)\n\nFilm Talks In dark uncertain tim
 es\, the power to reimagine history becomes a revolutionary act. With Ingl
 ourious Basterds\, Quentin Tarantino fuses revenge fantasy with metafictio
 n\, asking us to reflect not just on history\, but on how it’s told. In 
 this Cinema Dissection\, local filmmaker and PBS producer Jeremy Cropf lea
 ds a detailed\, shot-by-shot analysis of how the film’s formal elements
 —long takes\, stylized violence\, genre blending\, and tonal shifts—re
 veal deeper truths about who controls the stories we inherit. From the ico
 nic opening to the blazing finale\, join us as we explore the film's layer
 ed commentary on mythmaking\, propaganda\, and cultural memory.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.siff.net/programs-and-events/education/adult-film-education/film-talk
 s/cinema-dissection-inglourious-basterds\n\nEstimated start: 10:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
